## Project tracking — REQUIRED

`TASKS.md` is the single source of truth for project status. After every completed task or answered **project** question (including subagent work), before ending your turn:

1. Update task checkboxes in `TASKS.md` (`[x]` done, `[~]` partial, `[!]` blocked) with counts/notes inline.
2. Add one line at the top of the **Activity Log**: `YYYY-MM-DD — what was done — task id(s)`.
3. Update **Current phase** and **Last updated**.
4. Add new blockers/client questions to **Blockers / Open Questions**; remove resolved ones.
5. Work outside the listed tasks: log it, marked "out of scope of quote".

Do not log or commit general questions unrelated to this client project.
Subagents: include "update TASKS.md per CLAUDE.md when done" in every delegated prompt.
Commit after each completed task (including the TASKS.md update) with a message naming the task id; don't commit for answers that changed nothing.
Never tick a phase's "Client approved" line unless the user says the client approved / paid.

